&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://react-aria.adobe.com/releases/v1-22-0" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;React Aria 1.22 - New Sheet component, virtual-keyboard-aware overlays&lt;/a&gt; - The new swipeable &lt;a href="https://react-aria.adobe.com/blog/sheet" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Sheet component&lt;/a&gt; uses no JS touch handlers, only CSS scroll snapping and view timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/vercel/satori/releases" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Satori 0.36 → 0.55 - Converts JSX/HTML and CSS to SVG&lt;/a&gt; - Lots of releases this week, notably switching its layout engine from Yoga to Taffy, unlocking many new features like CSS grid and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/storybookjs/vitest-plugin-rsc/releases/tag/v0.3.0" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Vitest Plugin RSC 0.3 - Run Next.js App Router apps in Vitest Browser Mode&lt;/a&gt; - Lets you test the full RSC pipeline (server render, hydration, Server Actions) of a component or a whole route. Requires Next.js 16.4+.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://base-ui.com/react/overview/releases/v1-9-0" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Base UI 1.9 - Filterable Menu, faster Select/Combobox/Menu, improved Drawer gestures&lt;/a&gt;
