&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/releases/tag/vinext%401.1.0" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Vinext 1.1 - Next.js parity fixes, stale-while-revalidate for &lt;code&gt;"use cache"&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
